@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1/employees
@employeeId = 000000000000000000000001

### Listado completo
GET {{baseUrl}}

### Paginación
GET {{baseUrl}}?page=1&limit=10

### Crear: copiar data._id a employeeId
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombre":"Andrés Mendoza","cargo":"Arquitecto","departamento":"Innovación","sueldo":4500}

### Consulta individual
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{employeeId}}

### Sustitución de campos de negocio
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{employeeId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombre":"Andrés Mendoza","cargo":"Director","departamento":"Innovación","sueldo":5000}

### Actualización parcial
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{employeeId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sueldo":5500}

### Eliminar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{employeeId}}

### Validación: 400 antes de persistir
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombre":"An","cargo":"Developer","departamento":"TI","sueldo":-200}

### ID inválido: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/incorrecto

### Recurso inexistente: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/ffffffffffffffffffffffff
